  "transcript": "Hi Scott, this is Annie from LeadFlow. I saw you're hiring an administrative project assistant, which tells me the manual side of DRE processing is eating real time right now. Filling out those public report PDFs from scratch on every project is the kind of work that bogs down good people fast. So here's what I'd like to do. Let me take your next real project and autofill the DRE forms from a single intake form completely free, and I'll have everything back to you within 24 hours. If it's useful, we talk. If not, no hard feelings. Just say yes, and I'll get started.",
